{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggZrEqXWQzoCFvdpZaU1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Setup is applied. The smoke tests pass, but two things differ from the plan: the primary project is `main`, and \"checkpoint on compact\" shows as off.\n\n- **Project:** I couldn't create a new `ms` project. The default path (`~/basic-memory/ms`) is nested inside the existing `main` project, and Basic Memory doesn't allow that. `main` was empty, so I used it as `primaryProject`.\n- **Session profile:** `coding`, with `repository: \"ms\"` (the directory name, since there's no git remote).\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task into `main/schemas/`. None existed before. The schema fields are nested objects, and the Coding Session frontmatter reads back correctly.\n- **Placement:** `main` has no notes yet, so I stored a light suggestion rather than learned conventions. It is `sessions/`, `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `notes/` and `schemas/`, and none of the folders have been created.\n- **Shared skills:** the `memory-*` skills are installed at user level, and this isn't the skills' source repo.\n- **Settings:** I wrote `.claude/settings.local.json` (personal, not committed) with `outputStyle: \"basic-memory\"` and `captureEvents: true`. It's untracked, so move the block into `.claude/settings.json` if you want it as a team default.\n- **Smoke test:**\n  - The open-decision query ran cleanly with 0 results.\n  - The schema query returned all three schemas.\n  - Hook status found the settings and reports project `main`, profile `coding`, repository `ms` and capture on.\n  - The shared inbox has 1 pending envelope, 0 archived, and has never been flushed.\n- **PreCompact checkpoint:** hook status shows \"checkpoint on compact: off\". The config has `preCompactCapture: \"extractive\"`, so this may only be how the status line labels it. I didn't dig into it.\n\nRestart the session to turn on the proactive-capture behaviour from the output style. Recall is already live this session.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":982,"cache_read_input_tokens":38462,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":982},"output_tokens":724,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"66979033-3f7f-4bee-aded-2a5728846423","uuid":"2a081ca5-cdc6-4bed-b70e-6cd5f021424b","timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:43:55.165Z","request_id":"req_011CggZrEbdv8hsTVmFpM65M"}
